From 72be998e1329ae83bcd2e7eb59ccda25b1af9e59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lvjunmao <lvjunmao@huawei.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:07:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add activation peak memory profiling for GLM-5.2

- Port activation_memory.py from v0.23 with absolute-peak sorting
- Add activation_peak_debug / activation_peak_debug_rank config fields
- Instrument target_model, target_layer, target_attn_sfa, target_moe_routed,
  target_logits scopes across model_runner, patched forward, SFA, MoE
- Silent during collection; single summary report at session end
- Requires enforce_eager=true (NPU sync incompatible with ACLGraph)

Signed-off-by: lvjunmao <lvjunmao@huawei.com>
